@startuml SD-03_Explorer_GetToKnowMeQuiz
title SD-03 · Explorer — complete Get-to-know-me quiz

actor Explorer
participant "Explorer app" as App
participant "Exploration" as Exp
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Explorer -> App : Open quiz
App -> Exp : Get quiz questions
Exp -> DB : Load questions
DB --> Exp : Questions
Exp --> App : Questions
App --> Explorer : Show quiz questions

loop more questions
  Explorer -> App : Choose an answer
  App -> App : Keep answer
end

Explorer -> App : Submit answers
App -> Exp : Post answers
Exp -> Exp : Calculate RIASEC profile
Exp -> Exp : Set social index
Exp -> DB : Load interest codes, portrait texts
DB --> Exp : Interest codes and portrait texts
Exp -> Exp : Pick 5 closest occupations
Exp -> Exp : Pick portrait for top type
Exp -> Exp : Label as self-reported
Exp -> DB : Store answers, profile, portrait
Exp --> App : Portrait and suggestions
App --> Explorer : Show portrait and suggestions

alt pick a suggestion
  Explorer -> App : Select suggested occupation
  App --> Explorer : Show occupation profile
else browse all
  Explorer -> App : Browse Galaxy Map
  App --> Explorer : Show Galaxy Map
end
@enduml
